# CLIP locator sidecar (Track M): Python venv + bytecode cache, never in git.
# Model weights are not vendored either -- they're downloaded on demand into
# ~/code/unseen-assets/models via HF_HOME/SENTENCE_TRANSFORMERS_HOME, outside the repo.
